---
import SketchSheet from '../design/SketchSheet.astro';
import '../design/design-aids.css';
---
<figure class="design-aid design-figure paper-surface" aria-labelledby="index-route-title">
  <span class="plate-number">Illustration · Finding customer 42</span>
  <h3 id="index-route-title">Finding customer 42’s orders</h3>
  <div class="root"><SketchSheet><h4>Root page</h4><p>Choose a child by customer ID</p><div class="ranges"><span>A · below 42</span><strong>B · 42 to 75</strong><span>C · 76 and above</span></div></SketchSheet></div>
  <div class="branches" aria-hidden="true"><span>↓</span><strong>↓ follow 42</strong><span>↓</span></div>
  <p class="phone-route">The root selects leaf B; leaves A and C are skipped.</p>
  <div class="leaves">
    <SketchSheet><h4>Leaf page A</h4><p>3 → row A<br />8 → row B<br />8 → row C</p></SketchSheet>
    <SketchSheet tone="teal"><h4 class="selected-leaf">Leaf page B · selected</h4><p>42 → row D<br />42 → row E<br />42 → row F</p></SketchSheet>
    <SketchSheet><h4>Leaf page C</h4><p>76 → row G<br />90 → row H</p></SketchSheet>
  </div>
  <p class="leaf-note">Leaf pages continue in key order: A ↔ B ↔ C</p>
  <div class="fetch"><span aria-hidden="true">↓</span><p>Follow D, E and F to their table locations</p></div>
  <div class="heap"><SketchSheet tone="blue"><h4>Table page 1</h4><p>A · <strong>D</strong> · G · B</p></SketchSheet><SketchSheet tone="blue"><h4>Table page 2</h4><p><strong>E</strong> · C · H · <strong>F</strong></p></SketchSheet></div>
  <figcaption>The root directs the search for customer 42 to leaf B, which points to three orders on two table pages. A real page holds many more entries, and a larger tree can have more levels. “Row D” stands for a physical reference, not an SQL identifier.</figcaption>
</figure>
<style>
 .phone-route {display:none;} .selected-leaf {color:var(--teal);}
 h4 { margin:0 0 .4rem; font-size:.85rem; } p { margin:.4rem 0; font-size:.83rem; } .root { max-width:32rem; margin:1.2rem auto 0; } .ranges,.leaves,.branches { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr)); gap:.6rem; } .ranges { font-size:.72rem; border-top:1px solid var(--color-rule); padding-top:.5rem; } .ranges strong,.branches strong { color:var(--teal); } .branches { text-align:center; margin:.7rem 0; font-size:.75rem; } .leaves p { font-family:var(--font-mono); line-height:1.9; } .leaf-note { text-align:center; padding:.5rem 0; color:var(--color-text-secondary); } .fetch { text-align:center; margin:.3rem auto .9rem; } .fetch span { color:var(--teal); font-size:1.8rem; } .heap { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); gap:1rem; max-width:30rem; margin:auto; } .heap strong { color:var(--teal); border-bottom:2px solid currentColor; } @media(max-width:600px) { .ranges {grid-template-columns:1fr;font-size:.8rem;} .leaves {grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:.7rem;} .leaves :global(.sheet-content) {display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:.5rem;align-items:center;} .leaves p {font-size:.82rem;} .branches {display:none;} .phone-route {display:block;font-size:.85rem;color:var(--teal);} .branches span {display:none;} .branches strong {font-size:.85rem;} .heap {grid-template-columns:1fr;} .heap p {font-size:.85rem;} }
</style>
